  "description": "Professional rich text editor for Blazor with 51 features, full ARIA implementation, emoji support (1800+ emojis), 27 keyboard shortcuts, zero JavaScript dependencies, 54 passing unit tests, professional SVG icons, built-in XSS protection, and dark mode. Native Blazor component. GPL v3 for open-source, commercial license coming soon.",
