  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.2 Emoji Support, Bug Fixes & UX Improvements (2026-02-08)\n\nADDED:\n- Emoji Picker with 1800+ searchable emojis\n  - Organized by category (Smileys, Animals, Food, etc.)\n  - Search by name or keyword\n  - Recently used emojis (persisted)\n  - Full keyboard navigation\n  - Dark mode support\n- Emoji Autocomplete - Type :smile for inline suggestions\n  - Quick emoticons (:), :D, <3) for instant replacement\n  - Full autocomplete (2+ chars) shows 10 best matches\n  - Keyboard navigation (↑ ↓ Enter Esc)\n  - Auto-positioning (viewport-aware)\n- 27 Keyboard Shortcuts (Ctrl+B, Ctrl+I, Ctrl+K, Ctrl+Shift+E, etc.)\n  - Formatting shortcuts (Bold, Italic, Underline, Strikethrough)\n  - Heading shortcuts (Ctrl+Alt+0-3)\n  - Font size shortcuts (Ctrl+Shift+> / <)\n  - Lists, alignment, links, emoji picker\n- 54 Unit Tests with 100% pass rate (bUnit + xUnit)\n  - Component rendering & initialization\n  - Accessibility (ARIA attributes, keyboard navigation)\n  - Security (XSS prevention, HTML sanitization)\n- Dynamic font size button - Shows current size at cursor position\n  - Displays: 10, 14, 16, 18, 24, or 32\n  - Updates in real-time when moving cursor\n  - Matches industry standard behavior (Word, Google Docs)\n\nFIXED:\n- Link button now functional (prompts user for URL via browser dialog)\n  - Validates text selection before allowing link creation\n  - Auto-adds https:// prefix if missing\n  - Shows \"Remove link?\" confirmation when cursor in existing link\n  - Properly raises OnLinkCreated events\n- Mouse click support for all pickers (was keyboard-only)\n  - Added @onmousedown:stopPropagation to all 5 pickers\n  - Fixes: Heading, Font Family, Font Size, Text Color, Highlight Color\n  - Prevents toolbar's preventDefault from blocking picker clicks\n\nACCESSIBILITY:\n- Improved ARIA semantics for link button\n  - Changed from aria-pressed to aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" (correct pattern)\n  - Dynamic aria-label based on context (\"Insert link\" vs \"Edit link\")\n- Complete ARIA implementation following WAI-ARIA 1.2 patterns\n  - All pickers have proper role attributes (listbox/grid)\n  - Color swatches use role=\"gridcell\" with aria-label\n  - Emoji autocomplete has role=\"listbox\" with aria-selected states\n  - Character count uses aria-live=\"polite\"\n\nQUALITY:\n- All 54 unit tests passing\n- Both keyboard and mouse interaction verified\n- Event callbacks properly wired\n\nSee: https://github.com/simscon1/BlazorRTE/blob/master/Docs/CHANGELOG.md",
